# build output (keep in gitignore, should not commit)
pages/dist/
dist-server/
*.tsbuildinfo

# EdgeOne server-handler 检测占位：cloud-functions/[[default]].js 与
# node-functions/[[default]].js 以几行的占位文件入库（平台按 Git 仓库内容判断
# 项目是否含 Node 后端；PR #93 实测仅靠构建期生成会报「No server-handler
# detected」退化为纯静态，/api/* 全部落静态）。部署构建时 scripts/build-edge.mjs
# 会在同一路径生成完整产物（~2MB，不入库）覆盖占位，EdgeOne 运行的是构建产物。
# 占位内容基本永不变更 —— PR 中若出现这两个文件的大段变更，说明误提交了
# 构建产物，请还原为占位内容。

# source maps (optional, can be removed)
*.map
*.js.map
*.css.map

# lock files (keep pnpm-lock.yaml only)
package-lock.json
yarn.lock

# misc
.cache/
.parcel-cache/
.turbo/

# cleanup scripts are tracked
!cleanup.bat
!cleanup.sh

# Security: Prevent sensitive files from being committed (Added: 2026-09-05)
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.cer
*.crt
**/.env
pages/.env
.env.production
.env.development
*.secret

# Security audit reports (contain sensitive information)
docs/3-Audit-Reports/
docs/*AUDIT*.md
docs/*SECURITY*.md
docs/TASK-COMPLETION-REPORT.md
# Local design/PR/review notes (kept on disk, not tracked)
docs/storage-architecture.md
docs/PR-config-unification.md
docs/code-review-*.md
wrangler.d1.jsonc
.wrangler-dryrun/
.tmp-dryrun/
